    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fixed window - monotonic deque</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/sliding-window-maximum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 239</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Sliding Window Maximum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A value with a larger value to its right can never be a window maximum again, so throw it away: keep a deque of indices with decreasing values, pop expired ones from the front and dominated ones from the back. O(n) time, O(k) space.</p>\n"
  },
